      "content": "GREAT GADDESDEN        LEIGHTON BUZZARD ROAD (A4146) TL 0310                                         (East side) 10/132                                  Nos. 19, and 20 - GV                                     II House, now 2 houses. C17, renovated in C19. Timber frame roughcast with dark weatherboarded gable to road. Steep old red tile roof. 2 storeys and attic, 3 structural bays, 4 windows long house facing S. Large internal chimney a third from W end, and external gable chimney at E. Tiled lean-to at W end. 2 boarded doors under gabled tiled hoods on curved brackets.  2-light and 3-light flush wooden casement windows. Small 2-light casement to attic in top of W gable. Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL0345810730"
    }
  ],
